WEBVTT

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:28.110
<i>James. James!</i>

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:29.530
What happened?

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.990
<i>I engaged the intruders.</i>

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.490
I managed to fend them off.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:37.200
I believe...

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.200
there are two left.

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:40.830
Okay.

00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:46.540
How is he?

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.000
Still critical.

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:04.180
Harry!

00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:38.970
Let me guess.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:42.430
You're here to kill Fred at any cost?

00:01:57.530 --> 00:01:58.780
So, this is the floor.

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:37.280
Don't move!

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:40.660
Lower your weapons,
it's just a handkerchief.

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:44.450
Put your hands up now!

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:45.950
Get down on the floor!

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:52.000
That would get my clothes dirty.

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:53.630
Here.

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:55.880
-I have something to show you.
-Don't move!

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:06.770
That's your last warning.
I'll shoot you next.

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:10.980
Calm down. I'll get down on the floor.

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:15.110
But what did I do?

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:17.320
I haven't done anything...

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:18.990
yet.

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:21.450
Damn it!

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:25.450
What?

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:27.370
Don't shoot! Friendly fire!

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:37.920
Wait!

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:47.510
He's here to kill Fred, too?

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:00.530
Get everyone out while we hold him here.

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:04.260
What a pity.

00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:07.340
I rather liked her.

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:14.140
Tell me where Connor is.

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:17.440
I don't have time for you.

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:19.940
But you do.

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:21.440
You have plenty.

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:24.780
You'll tell me soon enough.

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:10.410
You son of a bitch.

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:15.580
You're going to tell me everything.

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:18.500
Harry, you, too.

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:22.250
But for now...

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:25.300
we need to take care of him.

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:01.290
Two against one.

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:04.250
Seems like I'm at a disadvantage.

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:10.470
Don't move!

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:13.220
You're going to tell me
everything you know!

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:24.480
I liked these pants.

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:26.980
Shut it! Put your hands up.

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:32.240
Don't move!

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:34.950
Lower your weapon.

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:36.620
It's just a handkerchief.

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:38.700
I'm sorry,

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:41.750
I am a bit of a clean freak.

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:47.250
Last warning.

00:07:49.260 --> 00:07:52.300
Okay, you win.

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:55.850
Did you know?

00:07:57.140 --> 00:07:59.560
This is how these are best used.

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:06.400
Harry!

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:53.320
You finished it?

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:36.740
Brother.

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:02.560
Why?

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:16.780
I...

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:43.640
I'm not going to die here.

00:10:58.150 --> 00:10:59.650
Great city...

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:06.580
It's too bad that I'm not...

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:09.370
welcome here.

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:16.800
Fred's body...

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:20.680
He must have used the Mask.

00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:27.270
Why use it on his own brother?

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:31.520
Without a witness,
we can't build a case...

00:11:32.440 --> 00:11:33.980
against LIVE or the Masks.

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:36.020
Damn it.

00:11:47.740 --> 00:11:48.580
James!

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:54.330
I tried to stop Monica.

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:58.710
But she had already started
looking into LIVE.

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:03.380
It was only a matter of time
before she came to me.

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:05.550
And I was scared.

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:10.100
When she was killed...

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:13.560
I realized what I did was unforgivable.

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:22.530
Do you know what this is?

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:29.240
Sarah.

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:30.950
What is this?

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:41.630
You'll be testifying in court.

00:12:45.970 --> 00:12:47.220
I'll be killed...

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:53.390
before I can take the stand.

00:12:56.730 --> 00:12:57.810
Either way...

00:12:59.360 --> 00:13:00.820
you have no choice.

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:04.570
I just sent it.

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:07.700
Yes, as an urgent news bulletin.

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:18.210
This has been the best all-nighter
of my life.

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:41.320
Sir, please!

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:51.240
I'm James Blood with the SSC.

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:55.620
What business do the police have with me?

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:06.340
Steven Martland, please come with me.

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:11.720
Why don't you tell me...

00:14:12.680 --> 00:14:14.310
everything you know about this?

00:14:24.070 --> 00:14:26.400
You're not getting away with this.

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:37.370
Olivia...

00:16:57.140 --> 00:17:00.140
I'd like to ask you a few questions
about the drowning.

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:03.350
Is that the autopsy report?

00:17:04.310 --> 00:17:08.770
They say the death was an accident,
but could it have been a murder?

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:11.650
Hey!

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:22.080
Why don't you go home once in a while?

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:24.790
I did stop by earlier.

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:32.840
Besides, you work late
just as much as I do.

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:37.470
What's that?

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:42.890
It's an autopsy report
for the floater they found this morning.

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:44.520
I see.

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:50.900
The cafe around the corner is still open.

00:17:53.900 --> 00:17:55.740
I guess I'll run down there.

00:17:56.950 --> 00:17:58.160
I'll join you.

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:30.060
Richard.

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:32.610
He's home?

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:18.110
Why didn't he wake me up?

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:11.540
I knew it.

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:49.830
Thank you.

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:52.750
Sorry I'm late.

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:55.290
You should've taken the day off.

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:57.250
I couldn't do that.

00:20:58.170 --> 00:21:00.250
But it's your wedding anniversary!

00:21:00.840 --> 00:21:01.920
It's okay, go on break.

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:05.630
Who's next, please?

00:21:13.930 --> 00:21:15.190
Thank you.

00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:22.110
Who's next, please?

00:21:23.190 --> 00:21:24.030
Don't move!

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:28.030
Get down on the floor!

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:37.460
Put your hands up!

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:40.250
I told you not to move!

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:48.800
Hey!

00:21:49.930 --> 00:21:51.100
Hurry it up.

00:22:03.320 --> 00:22:05.740
Get your phones out. Now!

00:22:12.910 --> 00:22:13.870
Hurry up!

00:22:16.000 --> 00:22:17.580
Both hands on your head.

00:24:19.450 --> 00:24:21.960
Subtitle translation by Zensho Yamamoto
